message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "XYZ Trajectory Video Generator"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Attrash"
    given-names: "Mohammad"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mohammad-Attrash/xyz-trajectory-video"
url: "https://github.com/Mohammad-Attrash/xyz-trajectory-video"
abstract: >-
  A Python program for creating dual-view, ball-and-stick MP4 videos
  from multi-frame XYZ molecular-dynamics trajectories. The program
  renders smooth three-dimensional atoms, atom-colored bonds, fixed
  trajectory-wide coordinate limits, exact top and side views, and
  independently adjustable side-view magnification.
keywords:
  - XYZ trajectory
  - molecular dynamics
  - scientific visualization
  - ball-and-stick
  - CP2K
  - MP4
